<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 6.917 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 6.917 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 6.917 billion pesos in the secondary market on Tuesday through four credit auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>1.639 bln  7 days</p>
<p>1.639 bln  6 days</p>
<p>1.639 bln  3 days</p>
<p>2.000 bln  1 days</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
